@startuml lld-us15-sequence
title LLD-US15 Send money by NEFT or RTGS: sequence diagram
skinparam monochrome true
autonumber
participant Browser
participant TransferService
participant NeftRtgsClient
Browser -> TransferService : POST /transfers/rtgs
TransferService -> TransferService : amount >= 200000?
TransferService -> NeftRtgsClient : send()
TransferService --> Browser : UTR number
@enduml